msgstr " lists \""

msgid "\", but "
msgstr "\", but "

msgid "It is even set to start first, so every time the PC starts it tries this entry, fails, and you see an error or a blue screen."
msgstr "It is even set to start first, so every time the PC starts it tries this entry, fails, and you see an error or a blue screen."

msgid "This PC does not start from that menu now, so it does no harm today. But if the PC is ever started from Disk "
msgstr "This PC does not start from that menu now, so it does no harm today. But if the PC is ever started from Disk "

msgid ", it tries this entry first and fails. It is probably left over from a copied (cloned) disk."
msgstr ", it tries this entry first and fails. It is probably left over from a copied (cloned) disk."

msgid "If someone picks it in the start-up menu, the PC shows an error. It also makes the menu confusing."
msgstr "If someone picks it in the start-up menu, the PC shows an error. It also makes the menu confusing."

msgid "It is hidden from the menu, so it does no harm; it is only leftover clutter."
msgstr "It is hidden from the menu, so it does no harm; it is only leftover clutter."

