msgstr "\n\nNote: "

msgid " has no start-up entry. If this entry used to belong to it (because it was moved), use \"Rebuild the start-up files\" in its report instead: that writes a correct entry. Then remove this one."
msgstr " has no start-up entry. If this entry used to belong to it (because it was moved), use \"Rebuild the start-up files\" in its report instead: that writes a correct entry. Then remove this one."

