msgstr "No Windows was found"

msgid "Only Linux was found on this PC. "
msgstr "Only Linux was found on this PC. "

msgid "None of the disks has a Windows folder that could be started. If you expected one:\n- The disk may not be detected. Check its cable, or the storage mode (AHCI/RAID/VMD) in the PC's firmware settings.\n- A drive may be locked by BitLocker (listed above, if so).\n- The partition may have been deleted. A partition recovery tool (such as PATio LifeSaver) can often find it again."
msgstr "None of the disks has a Windows folder that could be started. If you expected one:\n- The disk may not be detected. Check its cable, or the storage mode (AHCI/RAID/VMD) in the PC's firmware settings.\n- A drive may be locked by BitLocker (listed above, if so).\n- The partition may have been deleted. A partition recovery tool (such as PATio LifeSaver) can often find it again."

