msgstr "Windows stopped starting after an update"

msgid "An update was installed only half, or it brought a driver this PC does not get along with.\n\n1. \"Undo unfinished updates\" first.\n2. Then \"Remove a recent update\" and pick the newest one.\n3. Or System Restore to the point Windows made before the update."
msgstr "An update was installed only half, or it brought a driver this PC does not get along with.\n\n1. \"Undo unfinished updates\" first.\n2. Then \"Remove a recent update\" and pick the newest one.\n3. Or System Restore to the point Windows made before the update."

